---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { staticPages } from '../../i18n/ui';
---

<PageLayout lang="en" title="Privacy Policy" description="Fincanla privacy policy: what data is collected, how cookies and advertising partners are used, and what your rights are as a reader." alternates={staticPages.privacy}>
  <p><em>The site owner is based in Germany, so the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) applies. The legally binding version is the <a href={staticPages.privacy.de}>German privacy policy</a>.</em></p>
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>The controller is the site owner named in the <a href={staticPages.imprint.en}>imprint</a>.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is delivered via Cloudflare. Technically necessary data (IP address, date, requested page, browser type) is processed to serve the site securely.</p>
  <h2>Data we collect</h2>
  <p>Fincanla has no accounts or forms. Visit statistics may be measured anonymously.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>The site currently sets no advertising or analytics cookies. If advertising (e.g. Google AdSense) is added later, it will only run with your explicit consent via a consent banner, and this policy will be updated.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>When you click an affiliate link, the store may set its own cookie to attribute the sale to us.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Contact details are in the <a href={staticPages.imprint.en}>imprint</a>. You have the right to access, correct and delete your data.</p>
</PageLayout>
